Z||000008||Mach10||06-02-2001||09:55 PM||||My count is 5-7K CDN. That's including most of the "nice" parts to have, and the work done. This of course assumes that I find a motor that doesn't need anything more than a cleanup and timing chain. The TDC is a little cheaper, but harder to find (complete. If anyone has a z34 they're willing to part with (booo!) gimmie a call! PLEASE!) and the motor needs a couple of things to keep running nice (New timing belts every 50k-km or so)||||reg||7
